<title>CHINA: M.Lynch sets Bank of East Asia warrants.</title>
<headline>M.Lynch sets Bank of East Asia warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Friday it had issued 200 million American-style call warrants on shares of Bank of East Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$31.80	 PREMIUM	 14.33 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.4557	GEARING	 7.0x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   11.MAY.98	PAYDATE	 29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  30.JUL.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$31.80	 EXER LOT	2,000</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
